cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pyprepchase in a publication, please cite the repository and the version you used."
title: "pyprepchase: preprocessing for CHASE/HIS Level-1 data"
abstract: >-
  Per-frame pointing model from the CRPIX header cards, sub-pixel registration onto a
  common grid, optional line-core extraction, quality flags and provenance metadata for
  CHASE/HIS Level-1 spectral cubes.
authors:
